window.products.push({"id":572163,"name":"Set of 3 Oversized Wall Hanging Jute Basket | Round Handwoven Southwestern Decorative Wall Accents - Room Decor Basket for Boho, Scandinavian, Farmhou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uHpmxOSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC WALL DECOR ACCENTS - This tray basket is a creative and charming addition to your wall decor collections. Thanks to its beautiful woven patterns and even natural color, the tray set falls in harmony with many styles of decor, adding a nice touch of natural beauty to your home. This wire basket is a great choice for fireplace decor, master bedroom, living room or kitchen decor. EASY TO HANG AND CARE - Thanks to the innovative weaving skills, these baskets are easy to hang on walls with an adhesive hooks or nail. If the jute baskets ever gets dirts, you can simply clean them with a damp cloth and let them dry in an airy space before next use. DIMENSIONS AND NOTICE. Large: 27.5 inches in diameter x 1 inch deep; Medium: 24 inches in diameter x 1 inch deep; Small: 18 inches in diameter x 1 inch deep. Please carefully check these sizes and the wall area GOOD FOR HOME - Meticulously made to details, MadeTerra woven wall basket set is free from harmful chemicals, odor or splinters. The colors are lively and vivid, the weaving patterns are flawless. It is an item of premium craftsmanship and natural sound, made to last and benefit your sustainable home for a long time. GOOD FOR MOTHER EARTH - Made Terra wicker trays are made of natural jute, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest. For thousands of years, seagrass is widely used by Vietnamese artisans to make home furniture and accessories. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and table serving solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our jute woven round basket, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Kim Son,the base of sedge and seagrass in Vietnam. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online. UNIQUE GIFT: The beautiful seagrass wall decor makes it ideal housewarming gift or perfect Gift for Christmas, Home Decor, New Year, Celebrations for minimalist, natural lovers or those who love home decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uHpmxOSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09HZ9JTSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZ9JTSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZ9JTSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572164,"name":"Sydney by Pat Saunders-White, 24x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nuxMmcaML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a tan dog. Instantly recognizable, the brilliant, saturated colors of Pat Saunders-White;s animal paintings have established her as a national pet portrait artist. Pat brings an element of spontaneity, boldness and humor into a genre that is often stiff and photo realistic. Pat's big 'Ah-Ha!' moment was when she painted her first animal. Fourteen year later, she still finds this an exciting niche. The first animal paintings in this new style and technique gave her a feeling of 'coming home' after a long journey. Pat participates in juried national shows and presents workshops in her home studio and various workshop venues. She donates her work annually to non-profit fundraisers. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nuxMmcaML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYCLM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYCLM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYCLM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
