window.products.push({"id":572388,"name":"NAYAZE Espresso Tamper 53mm - Premium Barista Coffee Tamper with 30LBS Calibrated Spring-Loaded - Professional Espresso Hand Tamper with Flat Stainles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317NvqhZGBL._AC_.jpg","description":"PROFESSIONAL COFFEE TAMPER: Sleek and ergonomic NAYAZE coffee tamper with an aluminum handle and flat stainless steel base. Balanced-weight commercial coffee tampers specially designed for professional results. Available in 4 different sizes. 30LBS CONSTANT PRESSURE: The coffee tamper's smooth and elegant design offers baristas non-stop comfort and usability even during long shifts. Built-in 30-pound constant force spring, each press can reach a constant pressure of 31 pounds, stabilizing the pressed powder and ensuring a uniform flavor. STAINLESS STEEL TAMPER BASE: The tamper piston is professionally machine-milled stainless steel. After the mirror polishing process, the surface is flat and smooth, and it is not easy to stick powder. Detachable. Water wash or put in the dishwasher. Professional baristas and espresso coffee lovers can enjoy the process of making delicious espresso by themselves. PERFECT EACH PRESS: Design with a circular baffle, the NAYAZE coffee tamper perfectly matches the size of the espresso portafilter basket, ensuring each vertical press, solving the problem of skew and pressure deviation in the process of pressing coffee powder. Feasure thick and durable, the espresso tamper is an excellent tool for professional baristas. GREAT IDEA FOR GIFT: The aluminum handles are beautifully anodized with a silky matte finish in the specified color allowing long-lasting durability and grandeur. A beautiful espresso hand tamper is a great gift for baristas and coffee lovers, especially for beginner baristas or pros.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317NvqhZGBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nayaze","source_asin":"B0BWFBKYZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWFBKYZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWFBKYZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
