window.products.push({"id":572459,"name":"Juicy Couture Brooklyn Vintage Reversible Bath Rug, 17\"x24\", Ivory White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFIaN7mmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create an effortlessly stylish feel with the Juicy Couture Brooklyn Vintage Reversible Bath Rug and update your bathroom décor in an instant. Each bath rug features a classic woven design in a variety of on-trend, vintage stonewashed colors. Available in Regal Blue, Dusty Blush, Dark Grey, Silver, and Ivory White in a variety of size options. Durable cotton and polyester is machine washable, making cleaning a breeze. Machine wash cold separately with mild detergent. Do not bleach. Hang dry. Rug grippers or rug pad recommended (sold separately). Includes (1) 17\" L x 24\" W rug. 80% Cotton, 20% Polyester. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFIaN7mmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juicy Couture","source_asin":"B08L4ST5S4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4ST5S4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4ST5S4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572460,"name":"Custom Photo / Text Sequin Pillow Cover Hidden Image Magic Pillow Case Unique Personalized Gift for Friends / Family / Pet (Light Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtlgzqosL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Personalized photo sequin pillow cover. An amazing gift for festivals, birthdays and celebrations. Surprise your loved ones and make them smile. We make pillow covers with any image or text you want. - High-resolution printing. Your image will be sharper on the pillow. - Flip the sequins by hand to show or hide your image or text. - Full print cover. No white border around the image on the pillow. - The cover has an invisible zipper.   - The back of the pillow is available in a variety of colors. Package Including: - 1 x pillow cover *The insert is optional. What kind of image can make a great custom sequin pillow? - Image with a minimum 1200 x 1200 px. - The image is not blurry or ghosting.  - Half-length shots or headshots are best. If you are not sure about the image quality, you can still upload image. If the image is not deemed qualified, we will reach out to you through an Amazon message. How to upload an image or add text? 1. Click the button of \"Customize Now\". 2. Then follow the steps to upload an image or add text. 3. Finally, click \"Add to Cart\". That is all. It is simple and fun. 4. Repeat the above steps to upload an image or add text for another pillow. 100% satisfaction guaranteed. We are responsible until delivery. If you have any questions about pillows, uploading pictures, adding text or shipping time, please feel free to update us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AtlgzqosL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B089R8TX86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089R8TX86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089R8TX86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572461,"name":"369 Products Chef Knife Bag - 18\" x 7\" x 3\" Waterproof Polyester Knife Roll Bag with 13 Slots, Stylish Leather Straps and Detachable Shoulder Harness,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zguY4et9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us 369 Products was founded to make high-quality kitchen accessories that are both functional and fashionable. The company is a team of designers, engineers, and researchers who work hard every day to create products that will ease users' working styles. 369 Products believes in creating user-friendly designs by using durable materials that stand up against heavy use. Work Neat and Organized! The knife roll bag is a modern and sleek way to store your kitchen tools. This 13-pocket bag makes organizing your knives, forks, or spoons easy and safe. The waterproof material also makes it easy to clean up any messes on the go! Perfect for Chefs Who Love to Travel With the detachable shoulder strap for those long walks home from work, there's no need to deal with carrying your things in both hands. Use the detachable shoulder strap when trekking through crowds of people at security or between restaurants on cooking tours. Its simple yet modern style will ensure it goes well with any wardrobe or kitchen decorating decisions, making this knife roll bag remarkably versatile. Additional Zipper Pocket on the Outside There's even an additional zipper compartment, so no worries about knocking over a pan and spilling spaghetti sauce all over everything. Easily access your most used, smaller items from the back of the bag without unpacking. Main Features: 1. Waterproof material 2. 13 pockets for storage 3. Additional zipper compartment 4. Durable material that stores kitchen tools securely 5. Detachable shoulder strap makes travel easy 6. Main material is waterproof polyester and straps, and the shoulder harness is leather 7. Very modern and stylish Dimensions: Length 18 inches x Width 7 inches x Thickness 3 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zguY4et9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"369 Products","source_asin":"B09672CDMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09672CDMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09672CDMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
