window.products.push({"id":572538,"name":"Wipaka Floating Shelves Wall Mounted Storage Shelves Rustic Wood Shelves 3 Tier Decorative Shelf for Bedroom, Living Room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Office.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p32I0l2FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADJUSTABLE FLOATING SHELVES: 3 tiers hanging bookshelves, the bookshelves are adjustable, suitable for books of different heights. Bracket size: 23.4\" high x 6..4\" wide, board size: 23.6\" long x 5.8\" wide x 0.5\" high. MODERN & RUSTIC DISPLAY SHELVES: Black brackets and walnut textured wood planks make our wall-mounted storage racks perfectly match the rustic and modern style houses.The floating shelves can increase the aesthetic charm of any contemporary home, but also enable a delightful decoration to match any design or style of room. FUNCTIONAL STORAGE SHELVES：It is a perfect choice for living room, bedroom, bathroom, office, kitchen, pantry to add extra storage space to store succulent plants, crafts, photo frames, toys, toiletries. Above your makeup vanity storage small items and cosmetics. STURDY & EASY TO INSTALL: The sturdy metal frame and board can withstand scratches, abrasion, chemical damage and corrosion, and can be used for several years without replacement. Load Capacity of Overall : 50lb. The shelf is easy to assemble, and the package contains instructions and complete installation accessories. PROFESSIONAL CUSTOMER SERVICE: If you have any questions about our project, please contact us by email, we are happy to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p32I0l2FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wipaka","source_asin":"B08BF6FN8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BF6FN8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BF6FN8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572539,"name":"Arthur Court Aluminum Deer Antler Dip Sauce Bowl Rustic Sever ware 5.5 Diameter x 4.75 inch Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gd74r-gSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Three Antlers overlap on the bottom of this piece for a perfect Rustic Centerpiece in a Cabin or Hunter's home; Texture on the Horns creates a striking contrast against the smooth finish of the Handmade, aluminum Bowl. This rustic piece is made from food safe aluminum alloy and contains no lead, cadmium, or other heavy metals Never worry about breakage or damage as the cast metal is lightweight yet built to last a lifetime Stag bowl perfect for entrees can be chilled in the refrigerator for a cool salad or heated up to keep soup warm Wash by hand with mild dish soap and dry immediately - do not put in dishwasher. Comes in Gift Box perfect for Housewarming or for your Rustic Home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gd74r-gSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arthur Court","source_asin":"B006YCW1GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006YCW1GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006YCW1GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572540,"name":"Irish Celtic Nativity Set - 10-Piece Set by Grasslands Road","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710mntLeybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Focus on the true story of Christmas using this charming 10-piece nativity scene. Mary, Joseph, Baby Jesus, and 3 Wise Men, are depicted with celtic designs on their robes and headbands. The animals include a camel, lamb, horse, and cow. The manger has a Celtic trinity knot at the top and stands 7 inches tall. The set looks as if it's made from ceramic, but it's made of light weight white cement. The Celtic nativity set comes in its own gift box. Makes a great present for yourself or a friend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710mntLeybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grasslands Road","source_asin":"B00P9M6ZSA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P9M6ZSA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P9M6ZSA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572541,"name":"Boraam Sonoma, Pub Set, Storm Gray Wire-Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81shNMQP6mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome family and friends to casual after-dinner drinks and easy Sunday brunches around the Sonoma Pub Set. This four-piece set includes everything you need to create a cozy eating nook in the kitchen or living area. The pub table is paired with matching saddle stools and a saddle bench, easily fitting four people total. The seats are all contoured for your comfort, while built-in footrests offer a place to rest your feet. Every piece is made from solid rubberwood in your choice of three available finishes Barnwood, Chestnut, and Storm Gray. Each finish undergoes a multistep wire-brush process to bring out the inherent beauty of the wood even more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81shNMQP6mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boraam","source_asin":"B09XGBSWRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGBSWRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGBSWRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572542,"name":"Full Proof Baking Sourdough Starter Jars with Date Mark Thermometer Tracker Notes Bands - 2-Pc 10oz Small Glass Jars for Sourdough w/Lid - Sourdough B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gW3sroDSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"2 SMALLER SOURDOUGH JARS SAVE FLOUR (& MONEY): Our 2 pcs 10-ounce borosilicate glass sourdough starter jars are perfect for Microfeeding and small levain builds. Maintaining a smaller amount of starter by Microfeeding means you will end up with less discarded & less wasted flour while still achieving the same results! This small sourdough jar is best for DIY home-baking start-ups. NO DETAIL OVERLOOKED: Full Proof Baking jar's dimensions & ruler (cm) allow you to accurately measure your starter's rise (unlike with most sourdough crocks or standard mason jars), and the Thermometer Gauge & Ratio Chart helps you optimize the health and activity of your sourdough starter! It also includes a built-in airtight lid keeping your bread starter fresh and safe when you store it in the fridge for a week or so. A PERFECT GIFT FOR HEALTHY BREAD LOVERS OR MAKE YOUR OWN SOURDOUGH BREAD - The classic look of our sourdough starter jars makes them a perfect gift for sourdough bread lovers. And to make life easier, we recommend you buy the complete sourdough starter kit from Full Proof Baking. Kristen has instructional step-by-step video tutorials that will help you accomplish and bake the perfect sourdough bread right in your home kitchen. PREMIUM STYLISH DOUGH STARTER CONTAINER - The jar gives an elegant look to your kitchen and is carefully designed to make your sourdough baking life easy without having the drama of unsuccessful dough starter fermentation. All you need is a perfect starter dough to start with. 100% BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Get your very own Full Proof Baking Starter Jars designed by the sourdough-obsessed baker, Kristen Dennis of Instagram - fullproofbaking! Also includes a helpful Handbook packed full of information about sourdough starters and answers to many FAQs. The sourdough fermenting jars are securely packed with an instruction guide inside the packaging box. If you have issues and you need more information, feel free to contact our team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gW3sroDSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Full Proof Baking","source_asin":"B09HJCKGTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HJCKGTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HJCKGTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
