window.products.push({"id":572555,"name":"Tribesigns 55 Inch Computer Desk with 4 Drawers and Storage Shelf, Industrial Study Writing Table Workstation with Hutch and Bookshelf for Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CkLIf-8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Simple & Vintage]: Meet your expectations in functionality and aesthetics! Simple lines and black wood grain look endows the computer desk with infinite charm, which is a visual attraction wherever it is. Industrial and stylish appearance fits well with any decor and creating a harmonious living working environment for you. [4 drawers & Opened Hutch]: The side shelves are perfect for stowing your favorite books while its top hutch can be used to display home decor items like potted plants and artworks. Plus 4 drawers can offer more out-of-sight storage spaces for essential supplies. Abundant storage space can meet all your needs! [Multipurpose Desk]: Measured 55\" x 19.68\" x 59\"(overall), length of the desktop is 47.24\". This multifunctional workstation integrates a computer desk, drawers, bookcase, hutch, and shelves can perfectly maximize your workspace. It is carefully crafted to fit all spaces, whether it’s a study room, bedroom, living room, and office. [Super Sturdy & Durable]: Constructed with 0.59\" thicker E1 board and 0.98\" x 1.96\" heavy-duty metal frame, which can guarantee sturdiness and enough to support heavy-duty loads. Besides, the coating surface plays a perfect role in corrosion-resistant, which makes the table shiny and can serve you for a long time. [Buy With Confidence]: We are committed that all of our products meet safety standards and our packaging is tested to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. If you have questions regarding the Tribesigns desk or need assistance please do not hesitate to contact us. （Notice:The desk came with 2 packages. )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CkLIf-8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B08YJXGQ2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJXGQ2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJXGQ2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572556,"name":"TIKI Brand Mixed Material Votive Tabletorch 3-pk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417mAD-SMIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nothing makes fun-filled evenings shared with family and friends better than the warm glow of natural flame lighting. A TIKI Brand natural flame table torch is the perfect accessory to set the mood for quality family time and provides a warm welcome for guests and friends. These TIKI Brand Mixed Material Votive Table Torches fit perfectly on any table individually, or group all three together for a brilliant centerpiece. Its four-inch clear glass fuel vessel with brown base can be tucked anywhere and coordinates with any décor. Fill with TIKI Brand BiteFighter Fuel for proven mosquito repellency and up to five hours of burn time with each six-ounce fill. The TIKI Brand Mixed Material Table Torch comes complete with a long-lasting wick and a metal snuffer to safely extinguish the flame once the night ends. TIKI Brand BiteFighter Torch Fuel sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417mAD-SMIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIKI","source_asin":"B07B37LZ6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B37LZ6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B37LZ6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
