window.products.push({"id":572590,"name":"Great Home Discounts Aqua Color Beanbag Chair for Adults with Faux Fur – Ultra Soft Feel & Comfortable – Durable Fabric – Sleek & Modern Design – Perf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-TyxB8TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy The Cozy Softness Of A High Quality Beanbag Chair – Starting Today! Do you lying back in a comfy chair that feels like a giant hug? Are you an avid lover of PC games, books or any activity that involves sitting really comfortably? Or maybe you’re just looking for a low priced way to change your home décor? Whichever your case, this beautiful high quality furry bean bag is just what you’re looking for! The Most Comfortable Sit For All Your Hobbies! Either you’re a passionate gamer that spends hours and hours before a PC or a console that even your gaming chair starts to feel uncomfortable, or a dedicated bookworm that needs to do some yoga after an excessive reading session of yours, this incredible fluffy beanbag is for you! It is 32’’ high, weighs only 4 pounds and is covered in the softest faux fur you can imagine – now you can enjoy your favorite hobby without ever feeling the need to get up! Sleek Design & Funky Style A super vivid aqua colored chair covered by layer of soft faux fur; can you really think of a better addition for your bedroom or your living room? This amazing furry beanbag will simply jazz up any type of room you decided to put it in! Premium Construction Quality To stand out from the crowd in such a wide market, using superior quality materials is not an option; it’s an obligation. That’s why we only use premium fabric and filling materials for our faux fur beanbags – to make sure they will rise up to your standards and last you a lifetime! So, What Are You Waiting For? Place Your Order Now For Your Own High Quality Faux Fur Beanbag – Quickly, Before We Run Out Of Stock!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-TyxB8TFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Home Discounts","source_asin":"B01N1WWKI9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1WWKI9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1WWKI9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572591,"name":"Forever Alone Meme Statuette - The Internet Guy Troll Face Statue - An Exploitable Rage Comic Character That is Used to Express Loneliness and Disappo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314iARlITTL._AC_.jpg","description":"No more chess games with the mirror Opening the front door of your mansion, the entryway is beautifully lit by a massive crystal chandelier. Upstairs are a variety of empty rooms you run past in the middle of the night, because of ghosts and all. Downstairs is the huge kitchen that houses the monolithic steel fridge, which contains a bottle of mustard, a jar with six green olives, and a Styrofoam to-go box that was here before you moved in. Just past the kitchen and the living room with the big screen, solitary Ikea Poang chair, and gaming console (with one controller) is your library. Your massive library houses hundreds of leather-bound books, warmly lit by your fireplace. On the mantle, just below a painting of you in a velvet robe, is a series of ivory busts. Among them: Shakespeare, Bach, Lincoln, Athena, Einstein, and one you've recently added. It will have been a decade tomorrow that you've lived alone in this house and it's time you commemorated that feat. Now, among the marbled faces of the greatest individuals in history you have... the Forever Alone Statue. Time to celebrate. You would invite your friends, but... come on... Product Specifications A beloved/hated internet meme, in statue form Now you won't be forever alone. You'll have this! Individually casted in resin and hand-painted Designed in Norway Dimensions: 7 inches tall with clear acrylic support rod and stand Weight: 1.5 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314iARlITTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Internet","source_asin":"B00FW3Q3CO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FW3Q3CO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FW3Q3CO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
