window.products.push({"id":572636,"name":"Coffee, Tea and Soup Warmer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414Bm6SxBCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep your favorite hot beverages at the perfect temperature. Use along with your favorite mug at home, in school or at work. Set any non-plastic mug or non-paper cup on the warmer and never worry about your coffee, tea, hot cocoa or soup going cold before you drink it Plug the warmer in, set it on your desk or counter, put your mug or cup on it and go about your busy day, knowing your beverage will still be warm when you're ready to drink it. Note: While this warmer never reaches a temperature that is hot enough to cook your beverages, for safety reasons, please keep the warmer on a flat surface that is free of clutter and never leave it on unattended or for long periods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414Bm6SxBCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaxiAids","source_asin":"B003E6HNMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003E6HNMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003E6HNMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572637,"name":"Fruit & Vegetable Strainer Set with Food Grinder Attachment for Kitchenaid Stand Mixer Fresh Fruits Jucier Vegetables Strainer Attachement Meat Grinde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZrKJovgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Fruit & Vegetable Strainer Accessories include fruit & vegetable strainer parts and food grinder (Meat Grinder). The strainer can help you to cook puree and strain fruits and vegetables for jams, sauces, baby food and more. The grinder can ground meat with great texture for sausages and burgers. This strainer part is not compatible with KitchenAid food grinder STRAINER ATTACHMENT: The strainer attachment works better for foods like cooked apples,soft with a flesh that you desire (the cooked pulp) which easily passes through the little holes, and other parts (stems, seeds, skins) which you want to separate. The cooked tomatoes separate easily, the seeds, stems, woody parts and any tough skins pass out the end. Notice:The residue discharge speed can be adjusted by tightening the screw. If the tail screw is too tightly, residue may cannot be discharged. GRINDER ATTACHMENT: You will get 4 different diameters of grinding plates,(Notice:We are partially assembled.If you found some missing, check the other big parts) 3 blades and 3 different sizes of sausage stuffer tubes. The meat grinder attachment is made of Food grade material, grind fresh meat for sausages and burgers, vegetables for salsas & sauces, hard cheeses, fresh bread crumbs. With the three size sausage stuffer tubes you can make any sausages you like. EASY to USE: Cut into pieces that will fit into hopper. Remove tough, thick skin or rind. Cook all tough or firm fruits and vegetables before straining. Keep your food clear After the ingredients pass through the mill, the strainer cone removes all peels, leaving you with finely pureed fruits or vegetables. NOT DISWASHER SAFE: Color tree attachment include strainer attachment and grinder attachment. All parts are detachable, you are able to clean it very quickly with soap, warm water (must be under 122°F), and the cleaning brush that came with it. Note: You need the grinder attachment in order to use the strainer, but you do not need the strainer in order to use the grinder (as a grinder).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZrKJovgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLOR TREE","source_asin":"B08HH7MGNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HH7MGNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HH7MGNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
