window.products.push({"id":572651,"name":"Modway Charles Grande Armchair in Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYCoDX14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Urban life has always a quandary for designers. While the torrent of external stimuli surrounds, the designer is vested with the task of introducing calm to the scene. From out of the surging wave of progress, the most talented can fashion a forcefield of tranquility. Perhaps the most telling aspect of the Charles series is how it painted the future world of progress. The coming technological era, like the externalized tubular steel frame, was intended to support and assist human endeavor. While the aesthetic rationalism of the padded leather seats foretold a period that would try to make sense of this growth. The result is an iconic sofa series that became the first to develop a new plan for modern living. If previous generations were interested in leaving the countryside for the cities, today it is very much the opposite. If given the choice, the younger generations would rather live freely while firmly seated in the clamorous heart of urbanism. The Charles series is the preferred choice for reception areas, living rooms, hotels, resorts, restaurants and other lounge spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYCoDX14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modway","source_asin":"B00CUAYT0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CUAYT0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CUAYT0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572652,"name":"Bear of Allan Stuffed Animal Growth Chart 65 Inch (Gold Moose)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7lB0FceL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About Product This snuggly moose growth chart is handmade by best material with superior quality. It is one of the most suitable products as unique gift to child during his/her growing up. The child height could be easily tracked by clear scale marks. Also, there are photo pockets on different heights to record precious growth memory. Quality Bear of Allan is devoted to implement quality as its top priority. The individual product provided obeys to all the international quality standards from different regions of the world like EU Toy Safety Testing (EN-71), US Toy & Children’s Product testing (ASTM F963-16) & US safety of Toys (CPSIA 10-314), etc.Control of Materials VerificationBear of Allan consistently searches for superior materials to be used in all their products, by leveraging top qualified suppliers. All materials will be subject to verification before production which helps ensure that any potential harmful risks to persons could be prohibited. This is the Bear of Allan mission; to make high qualified products.Management of Production ProcessTop quality monitoring has been accomplished by following Standard Business Operating Procedures and techniques to ensure the quality of each plush toy, provided by Bear of Allan. In addition, the finished products are reviewed with an extra inspection before delivery to customer. This is the guarantee provided with Bear of Allan to ensure top notch quality rate for all supplied products to customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7lB0FceL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bear of Allan","source_asin":"B07984NJMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07984NJMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07984NJMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572653,"name":"Ice cream Valentine Romance Atmosphere Light , Party Wedding Birthday Party Decoration Kids' Room Battery Operated LED Night Lights (Pink and Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XRYOCk0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Light Up Your Home with \"Ice cream\" 1. No more wires and cables. Battery required with ON/OFF switch on the side. 2. Hanging hook holes for ease of display on wall or just rest on shelf or table. 3. Durable & Energy-Saving & Economic4. LED bulb produces no heat after long-time use. 5. Wood exterior, sturdy but not too heavy.6. Designed mainly for decorative purpose. Cannot be taken as a substitute of daily lighting. Features 1. Size approx: Long 11.8 inch, Tall 5.9 inch 2. Material: MDF.3. Battery: 2 x AA (R6S, R6C or R6P) batteries required (not included) NOTE 1. Store the light in a cool and dry place and remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time. 2. Please handle this product with care to avoid damage to the bulbs. 3. If hanging, please ensure the hook steady to prevent falling. 4. Some products may have flashing lights, try moving the switch to the left or right to improve poor switch contact. If it does not light up, try replacing the battery or contact us to solve the problem. ATTENTION 1. The user should notice a message that \"R6.AA.UM3-1.5V\" is printed on the battery inner box. This can be regarded as a battery instruction. The manufacturer recommends using R6-AA-1.5V batteries (including R6S, R6C and R6P). Because the current of some alkaline batteries is too large, it will have a certain impact on simple circuits, such as the light bulb will not light up. Of course, we are not denying all alkaline batteries. We just make a certain analysis on the battery instructions. It is recommended to avoid using alkaline batteries with high current as much as possible.2. In addition, there are many users of Sweet FanMuLin decorative light products. We welcome users to share the brand of the battery they use. This will be an interesting thing, right?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XRYOCk0NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet FanMuLin","source_asin":"B07D8SY75W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D8SY75W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D8SY75W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
