window.products.push({"id":572760,"name":"EVATONTT Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener with One-Key Automatic Opening, Smooth Edge Battery Powered Can Openers for Chef's, Arthritis, Wea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w9pCJNe3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why choose our Electric Can Opener?This automatic can opener features a sharp blade that is safely recessed within the unit. This safety feature helps prevent accidental cuts to your fingers when searching for the tool in your kitchen drawers.Using a can opener couldn’t be simpler with the straightforward design of the Automatic Can Opener. To open a can, position the rim of the can in between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the rim of the can through the can opener so it moves in a full 360° circle by itself.Hygienic - Cuts from side of can without leaving sharp edges, lid will never falls into can and touch on food.Operation steps:1. Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel2. With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can3. When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter4. Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the canWarm Tips:1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery.2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can.3. If the can is get stuck, please press the black button on the top of the can opener.4. 100% refund if our product did not satisfy you!Package Contents:1 x Electric Can Openers1 x Use Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w9pCJNe3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVATONTT","source_asin":"B09G6JG5SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G6JG5SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G6JG5SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
