window.products.push({"id":572774,"name":"Ecolunchbox Lunch Pod Stainless Steel Snack Container (4-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LXero3DeL._AC_.jpg","description":"RECTANGULAR STAINLESS STEEL SNACK CUP: Built to last from 100% rugged and tested stainless steel, this ECOlunchbox holds 5 oz (⅔ cup) and measures 3 ¾ inches long by 2 ¼ inches wide by 1 ½ inches deep. The stainless steel ECOlunchpod snack container is ideally sized for packing loose snacks like nuts, dried fruit, cheese cubes, apple slices, carrot sticks, pretzel sticks, etc. Pack of 4. NOT LEAK-PROOF: The container’s stainless steel lid is easy to use, even for small hands. There are no gaskets in this lunchbox’s design, so it’s not appropriate for packing wet foods that might leak. If you’re looking for a leak-proof food container, check out other products by ECOlunchbox, such as our Blue Water Bento Splash Box and Blue Water Bento Seal Cup Trio that have silicone lids. 100% PLASTIC FREE, NON BREAKABLE & BPA-FREE: Made from the high-quality, food-safe stainless steel. Steel container is lighter than a comparable glass container and virtually non-breakable. ECOlunchbox stainless steel food containers, which are third party independently tested, are free of estrogen-mimicking toxins commonly found in plastic, such as BPA (bisphenol-A), BPS (bisphenol-S) and phthalates. DISHWASHER SAFE: All parts of our stainless steel bento boxes are dishwasher safe, including the lid! No need to hand wash lids separately from the container bases like with other brands with lids made from plastic or with embedded gunky gaskets. TRUSTED MISSION-BASED BRAND: California eco mom and environmentalist Sandra Ann Harris designed the original ECOlunchbox stainless steel food container more than 10 years ago to pack lunches for her family. The woman-owned company continues as a mission-based, family-owned business dedicated to helping people reduce their dependence on plastics for health and environmental reasons. We stand behind our products and offer a one-year limited warranty against manufacturer’s defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LXero3DeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecolunchbox","source_asin":"B07V7HV63L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V7HV63L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V7HV63L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
