window.products.push({"id":572797,"name":"Cospring Handmade Wood Bowl, Mug, for Rice, Soup, Dip, Coffee, Tea, Decoration (1PC Rubberwood Cup, 3 inch Dia by 3-1/8 inch High)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DfV-lwzSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"How nice to see the natural character in the mug, while respecting the part of the life of a tree went into making it! Each Cospring wooden mug is unique since it is a natural product and wood grain varies by year and the tree grows. The mug is lathe-turned from ONE solid piece of hard wood, NOT from pressed and glued pieces. Each mug is manual grinding and hand sealed with natural plant oily finish which is food safe. There are various wood grain and shades of grey, brown and red that really make the mug unique. They are spectacularly beautiful though, and highly prized for their unique grain patter. The mug would look great on a table. ATTENTION Hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. Please avoid the wood products being kept in dishwasher, microwave oven, dryer or exposure under sunlight.  Periodically wipe with a bit of olive oil, using a towel and wipe off the excess to restore the wood grain to its original beauty when it appears to be drying out. You will have years of enjoyment with proper care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DfV-lwzSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cospring","source_asin":"B01N3LL3DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3LL3DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3LL3DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
