window.products.push({"id":572968,"name":"IPKIG Power Lift Chairs Recliners for Elderly with Massage and Heated, Faux Leather Power Recliner Chair with USB Ports/2 Remote Control/4 Side Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DtvpBIiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELECTRIC LIFT RECLINER CHAIR: The wingback design and faux leather looks elegant and brings a good visual hierarchy, update your room instantly. With just the push of a button on the white remote, then great simultaneous powered recline of chair back while the footrest is raised, smooth reclining function for optimal comfort. This power lift recliner chair is an dependable relaxation solution for you, it can reclines up to 160 degree. (With lift function.) VIBRATION MASSAGE & SOOTHING HEATING: This power lift recliner chair comes with 4 areas of massage(back, thigh, lumbar, leg), you can use all or choose individually for full body relaxing at once, 5 intensities are available. It also comes 1 heating part in the waist area, make your waist warm and sooth the body. (Heating function works separately with vibration.) There is a timer function in 15/30/60 minutes which is convenient for you to set massaging time. SUPERIOR FAUX LEATHER & OVERSTUFFED PADDING: The lift chairs recliners for elderly has a thick and wide backrest, cushions, and armrests. Faux leather finish electric recliner, lining Springs with Overstuffed backrest and seat cushion will bring you more comfortable, just like the whole body is wrapped up in recliner chair, which provide a very comfortable feel from sitting to 160° recline of relaxation, it's a great choice for home theater, perfect for reading, relaxing or napping. WHITE REMOTE CONTROL: This electric lift recliner chair uses a hand-held white remote control instead of buttons on the side to control the lift, which is the best choice for people with arm injuries after surgery, which used to control the lift of the recliner is also equipped with a USB charging function, keeps your devices charging, you have no worry your phone or iPad out of power while sit on our recliner chair (Notes: The USB ports ONLY for low-power devices, such as iPhone, iPad) HUMANISTIC DESIGNS: The power lift recliner chair with pockets on both sides provides ample space for storing your phone, ipad, books or other small items and is convenient within reach. 2 cups holders on both armrests also meet your need, tea drinking at hand. If you drop water on it, it is easy to wipe with a clean dry cloth. We are committed to integrating multiple humanized designs to create more convenience for your life. WARM TIPS - BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: 1. Max reclining angle: 160°; 2. The recliner chair comes in 2 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver on different days; 3. Recommended Height: 5'1\"-5'9''. 5. 1 year warranty. If you have any problem about recliner chair, please feel free to contact our friendly customer team, they will resolve your concerns in 24 hours. Comes with assemble instructions, very easy to assemble and usually only need 10-15 mins to finish the installation. ABOUT ASSEMBLY OPTIONS: The \"Expert Assembly\" service is provided by Amazon and you need to select it and add to the shopping cart together when you place order, then make an appointment for the installation time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DtvpBIiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPKIG","source_asin":"B09Q8WTYRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q8WTYRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q8WTYRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":572969,"name":"Atelier Home Linen 4-Piece Bedding Sets - 100% Cotton Bed Sheets and Pillow Covers - Hotel Luxury 800 Thread Count Sateen Weave - Non- Wrinkle, No Fad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FMzUJ25HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having difficulty sleeping lately? The skies are dark. You lie in bed, wearing your most comfortable pajamas. Tired from a long day, you close your eyes hoping to doze off the moment you do...but you don't./br> You twist and turn, changing the position of your pillows while you're at it. Clearing your mind, you try again. After several minutes, you grunt in frustration. You're still awake and you know the reason why. Your scratchy bed covers and pillowcases are irritating! Start sleeping better with the luxury and comfort of Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set! The set includes 2 pillowcases, 1 bed sheet and 1 deep pocket sheet. All are sateen woven, single hem stitched, and made from 100% long-staple combed cotton grown in the Indian tropics. Each piece is guaranteed soft and smooth. With a 800 thread count, one of the highest on the market, it will wear well and become shinier over time. Our fabric is dyed with IMaster H20 to protect from shrinkage and fading. It also contributes to the cloth’s hypoallergenic quality. When washing, you can avoid wrinkling by drying naturally on the clothesline. Or tumble dry, sprinkle a few drops of water, and iron. At Atelier, we work from a 3rd generation factory with humble beginnings but can now compete with giant companies. We prefer not to mass produce to ensure that all our products pass the strictest standards before being delivered. Here are more reasons to love our cotton bedding set: ✨ Comes with a FREE hand towel ✨ Like hotel bedding, colors are solid without patterns or designs ✨ Choose from white, sky blue, beige, dark grey and dark lavender ✨ Sizes available: Twin, Queen, King, California King ✨ 100% money-back or replacement warranty! Enjoy well-deserved sleep every night. Add Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FMzUJ25HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atelier Home Linen","source_asin":"B07CWRJZWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWRJZWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWRJZWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
