window.products.push({"id":572992,"name":"Now Designs 55 by 55-Inch Spectrum Tablecloth, Sandalwood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X7TCjkSGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description For over 45-years, Now Designs has created fashionable, fun, and functional kitchen textiles, table linens, gifts and decorative accessories for the home. Whether it's kitchen basics, fashionable, trendy designs or gifts for any season, Now Designs' quality and workmanship is unsurpassed. This square tablecloth measures 55 by 55 inches, and is designed to fit tables measuring 31 by 31 to 43 by 43 inches. Tablecloth is made of 100-percent cotton and is machine washable. Amazon.com Now Designs Spectrum Solids Now Designs has been creating beautiful and functional kitchen textiles and table linens for over 40 years. We design high quality napkins, placemats, runners and tablecloths in a wide selection of colors and patterns. At Now Designs we take color seriously! We share a love and passion for color. Our mission is to bring color to your home. Add color to your table with our Spectrum collection of 100% cotton solid color table linens in sixteen bright, beautiful colors. We invite you to mix, match and use your creativity and imagination to color your table to reflect your style. Spectrum Solid Placemats Our woven ribbed placemats add some classic texture to the table and roll up easily for storage. Placemat size is 13 x 19\" - 33 x 48cm. Spectrum Solid Napkins These napkins add simple, classic style and color to everyday meals, picnics or special occasions. Napkin size is 19 x 19\" - 48 x 48cm. Spectrum Solid Tablecloths This classic range of tablecloths is the starting point for any table setting, whether casual or formal. Because they are 100% cotton minor shrinkage is to be expected after washing. Tablecloths are available in six sizes: Spectrum Solid Chair Pads Tie on an extra layer of colorful comfort to every meal. These cushy pads feature a polyfill interior and 100% cotton outer with handy ties to keep the pad in place. Chair Pad size is 15 x 15\" - 38 x 38cm. Spectrum Cushions These finely ribbed cotton cushions feature a classic button closure, piping trim and removable polyester fill. Cushion size is 17 x 17\" - 43 x 43cm. Education without Borders A percentage of the profit on the sales of Now Designs product lines go to Education without Borders. The objective of the foundation is to foster educational opportunities and provide educational facilities in disadvantaged regions of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X7TCjkSGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B008M133VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-572992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008M133VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008M133VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
